 4457   0418    '----- ShadRoom: loadroom hook -- reset state; on room2, stamp 
                the closed west
 4457   0418    '----- door over the open doorway. Runs BEFORE the player save-
                under GET, so a
 4457   0418    '----- player spawning at the door restores door pixels, not do
                orway pixels.
 4457   0418    SUB ShadRoom (q2$)
 4462   0418            sdwHave = 0: sdwArm = 0: sdwWant = 0
 4462   0418            IF sdwOn = 0 THEN EXIT SUB
 447E   0418            IF q2$ <> "room2" THEN EXIT SUB
